<title>USA: Excel says Telco merger to close in Q4.</title>
<headline>Excel says Telco merger to close in Q4.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS, Texas 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Excel Communications Inc, along with Telco Communications Group Inc, said on Monday that it expected to close the transaction merging the two companies in the fourth fiscal quarter.</p>
<p>The long distance companies also said that the waiting period required by the Hart-Scott-Rodino antitrust act had terminated.</p>
<p>In June 1997, Excel said it had signed a definitive merger agreement with Telco in a transaction valued at $1.2 billion.</p>
</text>
